    "detailed_description": "The block slime lives in the cave. Aim for the goal by making use of its characteristic of being able to make a big jump when you get on it.<br><br>-Story<br>Children lost in a cave of ruins.<br>Caught in a cave-in and unable to find their way home, they continue to cry.<br>Among them, only the bullied child, Slime Tamer, has a twinkle in his eye.<br><br>'So... this is the beginning of an adventure!<br><br>He loved and admired heroic tales, but a block slime appeared before his eyes....<br><br>Will they be able to return safely to earth?<br><br><br>-Basic motion<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/c81374d55640ab6fe3421aebc524aaf5.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>Lift the slime.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/29d9b0ea5687999c41dad92f65f996df.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>Throw the slime.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/fc8bd91e0b9290baf0937192419e80a9.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>Jumping on the slime will make it fly.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/865a236e5fd5c9ac4f1b144b2bc25ae8.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>You can also push the slime.<br><br><br>-Rules<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/a8e1395f5935068176ba95baf462d528.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>Aim at the goal before the time limit runs out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212280/extras/85bbffa612f85bbf3ef54c59be10f0e6.avif?t=1669367857\" /></div><br>Evaluation of up to 3 stars according to the clear time.<br>You can advance to the next stage when the star is more than 1.<br><br><br><br>-Single mode<br>Total 50 stages<br>Aim for the goal by using slime that makes you jump bigger, absorbs other slimes to become bigger, and warps slimes.<br><br><br>-Cooperative 2-player mode<br>Total of 30 stages.<br>Let's aim at the goal in cooperation with two people.<br>You can play online with Steam's Remote play together feature.<br><br><br>-Game controller<br>Left stick: move<br>A button: Jump<br>X button: Grab/throw slime<br>Y button: Used in titles and menus<br>Start button: Open/Close menu<br><br>-Keyboard<br>Left stick: move<br>z key: Jump<br>X key: Grab/throw slime<br>c key: Used in titles and menus<br>Speace button: Open/Close menu<br><br><br>F5: Reset",
